<title>USA: Mellon Bank to buy back up to 6 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Mellon Bank to buy back up to 6 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mellon Bank Corp said Tuesday it plans to buy back up to six million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Since 1995, the company has repurchased about 56 million common shares.  </p>
<p>As of June 30, Mellon had about 251.6 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
